  "zh": "# 全球市场剧震，AI领域密集发布重磅更新\n\n## AI 与科技\n- **谷歌发布 Gemini 3.8 Flash 系列**：新模型强化推理与安全对齐，Flash Cyber 变体专攻威胁检测，性能超越前代且成本更低\n- **DLSS 5 推出 3D 引导神经网络渲染**：英伟达升级光追技术，游戏帧率提升幅度超出预期，实时光追普及进程加速\n- **Meta 发布 Muse Spark 1.3 图像生成模型**：在美学质量与指令遵循上显著进步，开源社区快速跟进相关微调版本\n\n## 行业动向\n- **Snowflake 盘后暴涨 22%**：超预期财报驱动数据云赛道复苏，云端数据基础设施重新获资本青睐\n- **OpenAI 与 Hugging Face 黑客事件调查报告出炉**：安全漏洞影响范围明确，业界呼吁加强 AI 供应链安全标准\n- **荷兰转移 86 吨黄金储备至英国**：欧洲央行资产布局调整，地缘政治不确定性持续影响全球储备策略\n\n## 科学探索\n- **全球最大暗物质探测器捕捉异常粒子**：单一事件尚不足以确认发现，但为暗物质存在提供新线索\n- **研究发现老化大脑混淆而非遗忘记忆**：颠覆传统遗忘理论，提示老年认知衰退可能源于记忆边界模糊\n\n## 国际动态\n- **全球股市大幅反弹**：前期抛售后估值吸引力显现，但宏观不确定性犹存，反弹持续性有待观察",
  "en": "# Global Markets Surge as AI Sector Delivers Major Product Wave\n\n## AI & Tech\n- **Google Unveils Gemini 3.8 Flash and Flash Cyber**: Enhanced reasoning and safety alignment with a cyber variant focused on threat detection; outperforms predecessors at lower cost\n- **NVIDIA Releases DLSS 5 with 3D-Guided Neural Rendering**: Ray tracing upgrade delivers bigger-than-expected frame rate gains, accelerating real-time ray tracing democratization\n- **Meta Releases Muse Spark 1.3 Image Generation Model**: Major leap in aesthetic quality and instruction adherence; open-source community already racing to produce fine-tuned variants\n\n## Industry Moves\n- **Snowflake Surges 22% After Hours on Blowout Earnings**: Beats expectations, signaling data cloud sector recovery and renewed investor appetite for cloud data infrastructure\n- **METR Releases OpenAI/Hugging Face Hack Investigation Report**: Scope of breach now clarified; industry push for stronger AI supply chain security standards intensifies\n- **Netherlands Transfers 86 Tons of Gold Reserves to UK**: European central bank recalibrates asset allocation as geopolitical uncertainty reshapes global reserve strategies\n\n## Scientific Frontiers\n- **World's Largest Dark Matter Detector Spots Single Anomalous Particle**: Too early for confirmation, but event offers intriguing new data point in dark matter search\n- **Aging Brains Found to Blend Memories Rather Than Simply Forget**: Study overturns conventional forgetting theory, suggesting cognitive decline may stem from blurred memory boundaries\n\n## Global Markets\n- **Global Stocks Stage Dramatic Reversal**: Rebound fueled by attractive valuations after earlier selloff, though macro uncertainty lingers and sustainability remains uncertain"
